<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN DOUBLES RESULTS (1930 GMT).</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN DOUBLES RESULTS (1930 GMT).</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Doubles results on the ninth day of</p>
<p>the French Open tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>16-Rika Hiraki (Japan)/Mahesh Bhupathi (India) beat 9-Anna</p>
<p>Kournikova (Russia)/Mark Knowles (Bahamas) 7-5 6-0</p>
<p>4-Helena Sukova/Cyril Suk (Czech Republic) beat 13-Miriam</p>
<p>Oremans/Hendrik-Jan Davids (Netherlands) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>1-Lisa Raymond/Patrick Galbraith (U.S.) beat Rachel</p>
<p>McQuillan/David MacPherson (Australia) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>2-Jacco Eltingh/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat Joshua</p>
<p>Eagle/Andrew Florent (Australia) 6-7 (6-8) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Lucas Arnold/Daniel Orsanic (Argentina) beat Tomas</p>
<p>Carbonell/Francisco Roig (Spain) 4-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge/Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat 7-Rick</p>
<p>Leach/Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 6-2 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>Third round:</p>
<p>1-Gigi Fernandez (U.S.)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat Henrieta</p>
<p>Nagyova (Slovakia)/Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>(Ends double results)</p>
</text>
